
Follow these instructions and the ProChat will get located directly
to the right place in your disk.

1) The Dialog BBS uses DOORS: as a place for doors. ProChat should
   also be installed there. Make sure that DOORS: is assigned where
   it normally is when your Dialog BBS is running.

   ASSIGN DOORS: <the doors firectory of your Dialog BBS>

2) If you already have ProChat 1.0 installed, please rename its
   directory to something else or it will be destroyed.

   RENAME DOORS:ProChat DOORS:PC (or whatever you want)

3) Now extract PC.LHA packet, which you got from the ProChat20.LHA
   packet, to the DOORS:.

   LHA E PC.LHA DOORS:

4) Consult the DOORS:ProChat/ProChat.doc file for how to link
   ProChat to the Dialog's menu.
   The ProChat 2.0 is linked differently than 1.0 so you must
   read ProChat.doc although you already have the ProChat 1.0
   installed.

                                           Riku Puustinen

